{'symbol': 'NXPI', 'date': '2021-08-26 16:05:00', 'title': 'NXP SEMICONDUCTORS ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND AND EXPANSION OF THE 2021 SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAM', 'text': "EINDHOVEN, THE NETHERLANDS, AUG. 26, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- AS PART OF ITS ONGOING CAPITAL RETURN PROGRAM, NXP SEMICONDUCTORS N.V. (NASDAQ: NXPI) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS APPROVED THE PAYMENT OF AN INTERIM DIVIDEND AND THE EXPANSION OF ITS 2021 SHARE REPURCHASE AUTHORIZATION. THE ACTIONS ARE BASED ON THE SIGNIFICANT STRENGTH OF THE NXP CAPITAL STRUCTURE, AND THE BOARD'S CONFIDENCE IN THE COMPANY'S ABILITY TO DRIVE LONG-TERM GROWTH AND STRONG CASH FLOW."}